Package: ailangparse
Type: Package
Title: Client and MCP Server for the AILANG Parse Document API
Version: 0.4.3
Authors@R: person("Sunholo", email = "m@sunholo.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R client for the AILANG Parse document parsing API. Parses 13
    formats (DOCX, PPTX, XLSX, ODT, ODP, ODS, HTML, MD, CSV, EPUB, PDF, PNG,
    JPG) into a structured Block ADT and exposes a drop-in replacement for the
    Unstructured.io API. Includes an MCP stdio bridge so the package can be
    used as a Claude Desktop / Cursor / VS Code MCP server.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://www.sunholo.com/ailang-parse/, https://github.com/sunholo-data/ailang-parse
BugReports: https://github.com/sunholo-data/ailang-parse/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8.0),
    R6 (>= 2.5.0),
    curl (>= 5.0.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    httptest2 (>= 1.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = FALSE)
